{
  "_about": "The mistake classes tooling/mistake-recurrence.js counts. A class matches a lessons unit by its title first, by its first paragraphs when the title matches nothing. An anchor dates a prevention: kind rule or detector, repo mirror (the rules and lessons mirror) or code (this repo), a path, and a pattern whose first ADDED matching line is the landing. An anchor with no pattern is dated by the file's first commit. mineFixes names the mine-fixes classes whose rework fixes count toward the class. Overrides map <file>#<title prefix> to class ids and win over the matchers.",
